# Account records — password hashes, salts and email addresses. Unlike every
# other JSON store in this project (items, quests, monsters…), this is user
# data, not authored content, so it must never be committed.
#
# The folder and accounts.json are recreated automatically on server start
# (see createAccountStore in server/accounts.js), so nothing is lost by
# ignoring them.
accounts.json
accounts.json.bak
# Live session tokens. A token IS a credential — anyone holding one is signed
# in as that account until it expires, so this must never reach a repo.
sessions.json
